# Weights and converted artefacts are build outputs — gigabytes of them, regenerable from the
# scripts in this folder, and shipped to devices as Apple-hosted asset packs rather than through
# the repository. They never get committed.
#
# `models/*`, not `models/` — git does not descend into an excluded directory, so a negation under
# an ignored folder can never match and the `.gitkeep` below would be unreachable. Excluding the
# contents instead keeps the empty directory in the repo, so a fresh clone has somewhere for the
# scripts to write without every one of them having to mkdir first.
models/*
!models/.gitkeep

# Apple's ml-stable-diffusion checkout, cloned on demand by test_raw_model.sh. A third-party
# repository at a moving HEAD, not our source.
.vendor/

# The packed asset packs and anything else the conversion writes.
build/
*.aar
*.mlpackage
*.mlmodelc
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.bin

.DS_Store

# scripts/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the conversion and packaging code is the actual source
# here, and it is what makes models/ reproducible.
